# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The only difference between the circuits used in the Hadamard test will be "
"the phase in the time-evolution operator and the observables measured. "
"Therefore we can prepare a template circuit which represent the generic "
